Date: Thu, 26 Nov 2026 23:03:51 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] PlaitOS: the photo picker is the Plait library in picker mode

Other apps' GET_CONTENT and PICK (images, videos or both) now open the
Plait library instead of the legacy GL picker: the same grid, albums,
explore and search, only the requested type, a header with close and
"Select a photo" (photos, video, videos, either), no settings gear. One tap
returns the item; with EXTRA_ALLOW_MULTIPLE taps select and a filled Done
returns them all (data + ClipData, read permission granted). Back or close
cancels. Filter chips that cannot match the requested type are hidden.
versionCode 40065.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_017VXjYUWzBqMCeUoJD2Suc4
